  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdcb3ccf11472438fc1d/step-689b5500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt half the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdcb3ccf11472438fc1d/step-188d2510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Trim green beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and the remaining butter over medium-high heat. Cook onion and green beans until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend, ginger paste and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdcb3ccf11472438fc1d/step-85718520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in coconut milk and the water (for the curry). Simmer until thickened, 5 mins.\n• Stir through roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide rice and curry between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b0fdcb3ccf11472438fc1d/step-6a18d830.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
